# Git commit attribution

When creating git commits or pull requests:

- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` or any Cursor/agent co-author trailer.
- Never add `Made with Cursor` or similar attribution lines.
- Commit messages must be written in English unless the user explicitly asks for another language.
- Only the user's git identity should appear as author; do not attribute commits to the agent.
